// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  PSPulse Runtime - EBOOT main loop (PSPSDK + GU + embedded Lua 5.4)
//
//  Boots into the scene generated by the editor, renders it with the PSP GU
//  (hardware T&L + lighting), runs the shared toy physics and executes the
//  per-object Lua scripts. A HUD shows the game title, object count, FPS,
//  controls and the in-game console (SELECT + LTRIGGER toggles full debug).
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

